  ('platform.api.port', 'platform', 'API listen port', 'منفذ استماع الواجهة', 'TCP port the API listens on; usually injected by the host.', 'منفذ TCP الذي تستمع عليه الواجهة وغالبًا ما تحقنه الاستضافة.', 'NUMBER', false, false, 'ENV_ONLY', 'PORT', true, false, true, 'HOSTING_ENV', 'Set this variable in the hosting environment of every app listed under Scopes, then redeploy or restart that app.', 'عيّن هذا المتغير في بيئة الاستضافة لكل تطبيق مذكور ضمن النطاقات ثم أعد النشر أو التشغيل.', '[{"app":"HQ_API","is_still_used":true},{"app":"TENANT_API","is_still_used":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"scope":"HQ_API","env_var_name":"PORT","is_it_there":"unknown","value":null,"fingerprint":null,"description":"Read by HQ platform-api from its host environment.","is_still_used":true},{"scope":"TENANT_API","env_var_name":"PORT","is_it_there":"unknown","value":null,"fingerprint":null,"description":"Read by tenant cmx-api from its host environment.","is_still_used":true}]'::jsonb, '0617_ops_config_reseed', true, 1),
